# zhvault storage

- All durable backup/meta writes go through `StorageEngine` implementations only.
- Do not add parallel index/sidecar files for state that belongs in the engine.
- Derived artifacts (`graph.json`, vectors, kuzu) are explicit and documented — do not invent new ones casually.
- Engines: `sqlite` (default), `json`, `rocksdb` (file-backed stub).
